#: scenario4:scenario4_3A3AB18D_914F_4D7D_A8F8_47F3C26A1973
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c5d2cf8fa177a3bfc69590c2ef9c7e8fad0fa68112b6e8ab3117491a54f77ba9
#. default-sha256: 17803e1a6d8779b6d82d85cd19727c96266f3f09a2dc2b6ca9f196b0286e2cda
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_3A3AB18D_914F_4D7D_A8F8_47F3C26A1973"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It had been about a week since the White-Haired Girl had taken up residence in the mansion."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫彼女が館に身を寄せてから、⟪k:1⟫一週間近くが経とうとしておりました。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_CA14D481_F927_4BC4_9958_89127B00B8B1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dfa9ee6acff0724b1967d5108c3355ebab6443b029a650817c22edda8f2e35cc
#. default-sha256: 809b6b797df782307b88604e037de3eeb01a49757e98622aa11db06c8c2a2272
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_CA14D481_F927_4BC4_9958_89127B00B8B1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Staying in that house deprived of light was, I imagine, a very claustrophobic experience."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫暗闇の屋敷での生活は、⟪k:1⟫閉塞感に満ちていたと思います。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_A191B3E2_744B_40E6_BC31_09F8B9BC8D69
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c2c4a5e83caba60d9f6c679a27e8ad79de1bb314945b71d6b54c230d8217efcf
#. default-sha256: 69b24b6951038255a6d6c7dfab3c2c0a412b42ac929ba4de97341a5591f7d45f
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_A191B3E2_744B_40E6_BC31_09F8B9BC8D69"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫To anyone blessed enough to have sunlight as a part of their everyday lives, it would have "
"been unbearable."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫陽射しの下で生きることを当たり前のように思う、⟪k:1⟫平和な方々にとっては……とても暮らせるような"
"環境ではなかったはずです。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_FAFA92C5_1D4E_459F_9D64_B65AFCC317F0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 684b755406ef8f66293ae8e77ea9352176f2515e2e27e627d806f25d98d851b7
#. default-sha256: d8ac033fe1f92949ba1a18674b886ebfbb25f176aacab2f067c195f0f0e2e468
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_FAFA92C5_1D4E_459F_9D64_B65AFCC317F0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But for her, the mansion—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫with its prison walls and lack of either illumination or "
"recreation—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫しかし彼女にとっては、⟪k:1⟫娯楽もなく光もない、⟪k:2⟫牢獄のような館も――"

#: scenario4:scenario4_9D4BEBF1_80AA_4E52_98BB_1FEF04B35971
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9083c20464b28f3ba350f379784785c3282f29b9665e3c454f67d9802f211ed8
#. default-sha256: f39334573d0069c05515874760ceab25f1dc5efa54dda403e333fda069ddfeab
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_9D4BEBF1_80AA_4E52_98BB_1FEF04B35971"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫was the one place she could find respite."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫安息の地のように思えたのです。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_2C19D17D_1B86_464E_BD1A_5D58985CF708
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: de625751e36c7686505f8b2e5074db3cd77afb0e600d6979e3094f0d3d66fc41
#. default-sha256: 72d284544f9b6d28a1ad01f4ca4b5e536870327a121ae731a247416f6dd0c2a4
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_2C19D17D_1B86_464E_BD1A_5D58985CF708"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She and Michel continued to be distant, however."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫さて、⟪k:1⟫二人の関係ですが、⟪k:2⟫やはり相変わらず、⟪k:3⟫一線を引いたようなものでした。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_41A0DF7B_FEF0_4138_9D23_61C4F5FABF7B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 636e2061d362ffb386b4dcb01ba36dfeff7bd0aadd2cab74f1c0d965b6724f2a
#. default-sha256: 03ee23dbbf838fac8b9f6a638b43153e8219f932274a452086cb942b40e3f360
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_41A0DF7B_FEF0_4138_9D23_61C4F5FABF7B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He spent most of his time in his chambers, which he had explicitly told the White-Haired "
"Girl to stay out of, leaving her unable to close that gap."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫ミシェルはほとんど自室に籠もりっきりでしたし、⟪k:1⟫部屋に入るなと言われている以上、⟪k:2⟫白い"
"髪の娘も踏み込めませんでしたわ。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_419AA7BE_CF8A_47D9_B354_FE57A702C379
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9d057dc62e70a0a4ca375e2fbd17ddf569e9025500d6cd38ff4e0b78f0d66048
#. default-sha256: 783c09e8398ecb68fad09f7f01f6f02206e18aa1d61d579f45d4b54e2d8c6fe5
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_419AA7BE_CF8A_47D9_B354_FE57A702C379"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nonetheless, on the occasions they did cross paths in the hallway,⟪k:1⟫their eyes would meet—"
"⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫if but briefly."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫けれど、⟪k:1⟫ふと何かの折に顔を合わす際、⟪k:2⟫二人の視線は少しばかり絡み合うのです。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_BA131BFB_3883_4E0E_AA4B_FCA79D169316
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d68904b404bf339fc093408bfbed9b2b39bf261209049d97a5351f84ee8fe01f
#. default-sha256: cf50b701d80eb7f07382e4db8c201150749c989ce5e94ff51152c4835e5df7e3
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_BA131BFB_3883_4E0E_AA4B_FCA79D169316"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was never for more than a few seconds.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Whenever she saw him, she made a point of "
"giving him a little smile."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫それは、⟪k:1⟫ほんの数秒に過ぎません。⟪k:2⟫白い髪の娘は、⟪k:3⟫彼の姿を見ると必ず控えめに微笑み"
"ました。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_E589D0D3_9447_4659_B771_8331DEB129FD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fa86e9095db5b1a8c7e1b4e71c7284d3439927f9756e8b0f5ebd93ad8b6203aa
#. default-sha256: 96813d13270e61ab840b6487a93b6e9753e1a515ca64a967fcad370e9914f8ef
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_E589D0D3_9447_4659_B771_8331DEB129FD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He never said anything, but still, when she had first arrived, he would not have even met "
"her gaze."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫彼は何も言いませんでしたが、⟪k:1⟫最初であれば目も合わせようともしなかったはずです。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_47AC4865_F13E_483C_B557_9E8D0D9C0774
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4c3a78815e42fee01874fc5559ec87c777a8bf60094a1a86e92a6ab7c1a05793
#. default-sha256: ef1b8bc6763296fdeaaa643cc33dc923d3499e3119f738a193bbef744dc934c0
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_47AC4865_F13E_483C_B557_9E8D0D9C0774"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He seemed to be taking more and more notice of her."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫彼も、⟪k:1⟫彼女の存在を意識し始めている……そのような雰囲気でした。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_9050C588_7A68_4FEA_8488_372AA36F7653
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8f683a0e13c515e834a504ac211ebcd31fe983d7ea78fcb2c17dcda59d1e3745
#. default-sha256: 20c0267965df846d6f72c526c869a850a789870cfe447195b8cce951ed86cd40
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_9050C588_7A68_4FEA_8488_372AA36F7653"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫One day, the White-Haired Girl stood in the cellar, a frown on her face."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫\t⟪k:1⟫そんなある日、⟪k:2⟫彼女は倉庫で困った顔を浮かべておりました。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_1FAD219B_A05E_47E3_9C94_1A264074123E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 69f2b1cbc8f5b161ffdb1d5d87e7e8f358f39acaf7a792276601d097569e7200
#. default-sha256: 09022c3529b9e83e32f32be60f2bad49e30dac2f43ac7fe2e599d26e7e4868c1
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_1FAD219B_A05E_47E3_9C94_1A264074123E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫(Well, this is troubling...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I can’t go down to the village...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫but if we "
"don’t do something soon...)"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫（どうしよう……。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫　村に降りるわけにはいかないし、⟪k:3⟫でも、⟪k:4⟫このままじゃ……）"

#: scenario4:scenario4_C7C31BBE_4520_4B03_895C_9A9E2E31B043
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4d026d919c1781e09e16950b4342642b431b6b2660847cea3d76b6d52d6efb75
#. default-sha256: ebb8dbe630102fe29ffc8cfa496d48a45ac16b09ec227bb87d16f6d95a2eafa9
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_C7C31BBE_4520_4B03_895C_9A9E2E31B043"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_6772CFC4_884E_4AA8_BC06_143BC8034363
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 920b05a83dab46bf12ac77fadb90e1431f003de79eef05a18d38febef13c1ff9
#. default-sha256: 862aa759f2dcc352502b883121fcd250f1e57474f0f7755494cdaaaea998ec73
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_6772CFC4_884E_4AA8_BC06_143BC8034363"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The cellar was where their food was stored—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫an assortment of nonperishables and "
"dried foods, smoked meats and cheeses."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫そこは食料が保存されている倉庫でした。⟪k:1⟫置かれているのは日持ちしそうな乾物ですとか、⟪k:2⟫"
"燻製やチーズといったもの。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_7DF38F10_3DF3_45C1_9032_8EFC0EB9C983
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8616f13accedb9ea2823b2a355b988bd0154d666d517893169cf793433cb92e5
#. default-sha256: ce9001027cb54cc0b25aac55d876e97c732f0ccdf6cf9057ac39eb8c539d0979
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_7DF38F10_3DF3_45C1_9032_8EFC0EB9C983"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Her daily meals were taken from the supplies there. ⟪k:1⟫However, the stockpile was "
"beginning to grow quite small."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫日々の糧は、⟪k:1⟫倉庫の備蓄から得ておりました。⟪k:2⟫しかし館での生活が長引くにつれ、⟪k:3⟫蓄え"
"も底をつこうとしておりましたわ。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_9D1FF1CA_1B11_4CEC_884A_BED48D6AC2ED
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d75c63750ec60fbeeb4bc13fc2d56ea58c90e5d032245f1156820586d51f3ee3
#. default-sha256: 7e815433f4422b02c47e677f233f4b0f54049b37f3e714c72888c730545fdcc3
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_9D1FF1CA_1B11_4CEC_884A_BED48D6AC2ED"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Were she not on the run, she could have gone to the village to procure more."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫彼女が追われる身でなければ、⟪k:1⟫村に降りて食材を得ることも出来たでしょう。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_2E697E6F_E846_4699_A77B_01ABD9A7FE97
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4c2401a3817eba88e4e6ed418031c426152ed0a59d4eb4d6887cefb995c99965
#. default-sha256: 4f64fb7c024d666f974d5be3270f3ba7cc87190c92ee08909c045a6c3c5d9f29
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_2E697E6F_E846_4699_A77B_01ABD9A7FE97"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Or perhaps, were she a little tougher, she could have captured a wild animal for its meat."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫あるいは彼女がもっと逞しければ、⟪k:1⟫野を走る動物を捕えることも出来たのかもしれませんね？"

#: scenario4:scenario4_AD7A4BAA_BA3E_43B8_9766_C2C60BF2E6DB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 268ff417d0d0cc634f9f7194907a3dc4e90f5981ae6404cd9b67327d78ffd25c
#. default-sha256: f9ffbb35f57411002a71ac1282de78716e9d37029f943f312419d4df16542045
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_AD7A4BAA_BA3E_43B8_9766_C2C60BF2E6DB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Hehe... ⟪k:1⟫But Master, you know a young, delicate thing like her was hardly up to the task "
"of hunting for food."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫ふふ……でも旦那さま。⟪k:1⟫彼女のような華奢で繊細な少女が、⟪k:2⟫そんなこと出来るはずもないのは"
"お分かりでしょう？"

#: scenario4:scenario4_058A15FB_40C9_4C42_B7C6_7467071F65FD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bcbeb88fac0ad9b708d01dcd489f9a8f4976ded12afafddd34272413fc4a4555
#. default-sha256: 03ccc2d713c2828932c0a341babbbe8e5ada9035851fd5c818b7e68ff931cdb6
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_058A15FB_40C9_4C42_B7C6_7467071F65FD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫How does he normally get his supplies, I wonder?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……あの人は、⟪k:1⟫いつもどうしているのかしら……。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_0F8AAD60_039D_4743_90BB_E791E77745CE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f58c2ef3748806cc7f5719ce5ca4f7fd25c5ff35f4a3feb07252e2356466e95a
#. default-sha256: db9b53e9e20a770c7959c97bee59ca1d055d4fbd7baa8beaf725af516b57c3da
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_0F8AAD60_039D_4743_90BB_E791E77745CE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫From there, other questions about Michel started rising in her mind. ⟪k:1⟫No matter how "
"lifeless he seemed..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫彼女がそこで疑問に思ったのは、⟪k:1⟫ミシェルのことです。⟪k:2⟫まさか、⟪k:3⟫いくら生きた雰囲気の"
"しない青年とはいえ――"

#: scenario4:scenario4_87865C14_5F55_44EC_942E_30D9AA895D4C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 834083b023527fa820363d562d380b60d2e163927607afaf2bab1ee46fe95296
#. default-sha256: 1f401d86440cf8fe76f57dae3f0a81fe2f3634c49e04b4be2e783ad8122335a7
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_87865C14_5F55_44EC_942E_30D9AA895D4C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫surely⟪k:2⟫ he still had to eat, right?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫食事を取らないはずがありませんから。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_C7D68F39_01B3_452B_97D1_6070B28AC292
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d75c4c44ac89d674115c97715296114a444b85567921a971d449838536c9f2fd
#. default-sha256: f1aa08ed614cc541f74ae45080da88e7beb819dde96854ce88276c13e78ab7f6
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_C7D68F39_01B3_452B_97D1_6070B28AC292"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The White-Haired Girl nodded, then made her way out of the cellar, intending to head for his "
"bedchamber."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫彼女は小さく頷いて、⟪k:1⟫倉庫を後にいたしました。⟪k:2⟫そして、⟪k:3⟫彼の部屋まで向かおうとした"
"のです。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_4D147211_E99D_42C2_B81C_D7CE886146E1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ee1193cc22a0ee46566acf0893a94d6fbe896e6138a824cae2291d22870e8811
#. default-sha256: a30b12da73398c1d258de240fd2ff3d3d44f430c57676c278ea6306f35a547bd
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_4D147211_E99D_42C2_B81C_D7CE886146E1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ah..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫\t⟪k:1⟫\t⟪k:2⟫……あ……。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_3B0F559A_0143_4023_936D_B8594593E90A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ff75c533fff312a7d68c2de9bd4d75ad9d13011971c4c9ffc3c7b6a5626f4c95
#. default-sha256: 147e63bc1028488b1905fca40dc5dbc669a86500424a3fa19313a6a5cfae9f0e
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_3B0F559A_0143_4023_936D_B8594593E90A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But on her way there, she spotted him standing by the entrance,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫しかし、⟪k:1⟫彼の部屋まで行かずとも、⟪k:2⟫その姿は玄関にありました。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_E0603546_E5DC_49EA_85A5_308CDFAB747B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d651975a116502438a5557f283323a9b0d67187d136cb4e9a1cc61b726f14bcf
#. default-sha256: 04859e9c130d55d2608066c6584a2f8b19cf6d3a317a58b3dca725504cb597a0
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_E0603546_E5DC_49EA_85A5_308CDFAB747B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫staring motionless at the door, lit by a single candle. ⟪k:1⟫He appeared to be waiting for "
"something."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫暗闇の中、⟪k:1⟫蝋燭の灯りひとつで佇み、⟪k:2⟫じっと扉を見つめる姿。⟪k:3⟫それは何かを待っている"
"ようでもありました。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_F165E07F_0730_4DD0_BBF8_22866D9D8BAE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
